Chapter 1 Culprits
[signal arg="change_sub_scene: game"]
set {tries} = 3.0
label Point1
if {tries} > 0.0:
	Who done it?
	- Option1
		[signal arg="unlock_culprit: qilin "]
		jump End_Success
	- Option2
		Try again
		set {tries} -= 1.0
		jump Point1
	- Option3
		Try again
		set {tries} -= 1.0
		jump Point1
else:
	Manhunt Begins.
label End_Success
Let's go back to the board and complete.